# Optional. When set, `npm run ingest` also asks Meshy (https://www.meshy.ai) for a textured
# 3D model from up to four reference photos (multi-image-to-3D) and stores it, slimmed for the
# web, as public/items/<id>/model.glb. Each model costs credits and takes a few minutes.
# Without it, ingest produces a fully offline procedural asset.
MESHY_API_KEY=
